Page 1764 Template:RQ:Dunglison Medicine/documentation: -------- begin text --------
{{documentation subpage}}

===Usage===
This template may be used in Wiktionary entries to format quotations from {{w|Robley Dunglison}}'s work ''The Practice of Medicine'' (1st edition, 1842). It can be used to create a link to online versions of the work at the [https://archive.org Internet Archive]:

* [https://archive.org/details/63350850RX1.nlm.nih.gov/page/n2/mode/1up Volume I].
* [https://archive.org/details/63350850RX2.nlm.nih.gov/page/n4/mode/1up Volume II].


===Parameters===
The template takes the following parameters:
{{quote-meta/paramdoc|1=
* {{para|1}} or {{para|volume}} – '''mandatory''': the volume number quoted from in uppercase Roman numerals, either {{para|volume|I}} or {{para|volume|II}}.
<<chapter:2>>
* {{para|section}} – the section number quoted from in uppercase Roman numerals, followed by the name of the section in parentheses (see the examples [[#Examples|below]]).
<<page:3>>
<<passage:4>>
<<trailing_params>>
}}


===Examples===
* '''Wikitext''':
** {{temp|RQ:Dunglison Medicine|2=volume=II|3=chapter=Of the Neuroses|4=section=III (Perversion of Sensibility)|5=page=280|6=passage=<nowiki>The smell, too, is often perverted—'''''Parosmia'''''. The author was formerly acquainted with a lady, who scented her snuff with the tincture of assafœtida.</nowiki>}}; or
** {{temp|RQ:Dunglison Medicine|2=II|3=Of the Neuroses|4=section=III (Perversion of Sensibility)|5=280|6=<nowiki>The smell, too, is often perverted—'''''Parosmia'''''. The author was formerly acquainted with a lady, who scented her snuff with the tincture of assafœtida.</nowiki>}}
* '''Result''':
** {{RQ:Dunglison Medicine|volume=II|chapter=Of the Neuroses|page=280|passage=The smell, too, is often perverted—'''''Parosmia'''''. The author was formerly acquainted with a lady, who scented her snuff with the tincture of assafœtida.}}
{{Robley Dunglison quotation templates}}
{{tcat|lang=en}}
-------- end text --------
