|t=Gaius Aurelius Parthenius, honored with ornaments of ''decurio'' at the ''Colonia Augusta Nemausus'' {{q-g|Nîmes}}, ''sevir Augustalis'' at the ''Colonia Copia Claudia Augusta Lugdunum'' {{q-g|Lyon}}, likewise at ''Narbo Martius'' {{q-g|Narbonne}} and at ''Firma Julia Secundanorum Aurasio'' {{q-g|Orange}} and at ''Forum Julii Pacatum'' {{q-g|Fréjus}}. Everywhere the honours were received for nothing in return.}}<noinclude>{{documentation}}</noinclude>
