|chapter        = {{#switch:{{{chapter|{{{1|}}}}}}
        |1|I      = The Dẏffeꝛence betwene dominiu̇̑ Regale and dom̑iu̇̑ Politicu̇̑ ⁊ Regale
        |2|II     = Whẏ One Kẏng Reynith Regalit͛ tṁ̑ / and an other Reẏnith Politicȗ ⁊ Regalit͛
        |3|III    = Heꝛe After be Shewyd the Fꝛutes of Jus Regale and the Fꝛutes of Jus Politicu̇̑ et Regale
        |4|IV     = Heꝛe Aft͛ ys Schewyd hou the Reuenuz of Fruͣnce be made gͭ
        |5|V      = The Harmes þͭ come of a Kyngꝰ Poveꝛte
        |6|VI     = Oꝛdynuͣnce ﬀoꝛ the kyngꝰ oꝛdenaꝛye chaꝛgys
        |7|VII    = The kyngꝰ extoꝛdynaꝛye chaꝛgys
        |8|VIII   = Yf the kyngꝰ lyvelood suffyce nott hıs subgettys / aught to make yt ſuffycyent
        |9|IX     = Heꝛe afteꝛ be ſchewyd the ꝑılles that may come to the kyng by oveꝛ mẏghtẏ Subgettꝰ
        |10|X     = Hou that the cꝛowne may be beſt endowed
        |11|XI    = Heꝛe after ẏs Schewẏd what of the Kẏngꝰ lyvelood gevẏn away / maẏ beſt be takẏn ageẏne
        |12|XII   = Heꝛe aft͛ ys schewyd what haꝛme would come to Englond yf the cȏmons theꝛof weꝛe pooꝛe
        |13|XIII  = Onely lacke of Haꝛte and Cowaꝛdıſe kepyn the ﬀꝛenche men fꝛom Rysyng 
        |14|XIV   = Heꝛe aft͛ is schewyd why yt nedıth þͭ ther be a reſu̇̑mpcoū ⁊ guͣnt of goode made to þͤ kyng 
        |15|XV    = Hou þͤ kyngꝰ cȏnceıl may be beſt choſyn ⁊ eſtablyſchyd 
        |16|XVI   = Hou the Romaynes pꝛoſpeꝛyd whıles thay had a gꝛete counceyle
        |17|XVII  = Heꝛe ﬀolowen adu͛tıſemᵗꝰ ﬀoꝛ the gevyng of the kyngꝰ offyces
        |18|XVIII = Adu͛tıſemᵗ hou coꝛodıes ⁊ pencıons may beſt be gevyn
        |19|XIX   = Hou gꝛete goode wyll gꝛowe of the foꝛme endowyng of the coꝛowne
        |20|XX   = Adu͛tiſemᵗ ﬀoꝛ makyng of Patentꝰ of gẏftꝰ
