See [[:Category:Old Irish descendants to be fixed in desctree]]. The module is designed to only show the error in preview, so you may not have noticed. Thanks! [[User:Chuck Entz|Chuck Entz]] ([[User talk:Chuck Entz|talk]]) 05:49, 3 October 2022 (UTC)

